## Remove undocumented registry_transfer CLI docs (#227)

Context: docs/advanced_features.md described scripts/registry_transfer.sh and
src/cli/registry_transfer.py, which were never shipped (docs-only since Apr 2026).
Issue #227 reported the gap. Doc correction already landed on 0.9.2 and 0.10.0;
this backports it to the 0.9.3 milestone branch so published guidance matches
shipped OBX UI + GitHub mirror paths only.

Changes:

1. docs/advanced_features.md
   Drop the non-existent CLI zip / registry_transfer.sh workflow; keep OBX UI and
   GitHub mirror; add Listing domains (Registry → Browse) and Large registries
   workarounds (batch OBX by domain, or restore via GitHub).
2. docs/README.md
   Point the advanced-features index blurb at shipped transfer paths only.
3. README.md
   Remove registry_transfer CLI references from the top-level docs pointers.
4. tests/units/api/test_help_api.py
   Align Help API expectations with the corrected advanced_features content.

